WEBVTT

00:00.470 --> 00:04.810
Oh please come down like an angel
Oh please come down like an angel

00:04.810 --> 00:12.530
Asano hitogomi o nagamete coffee nondeiru
Watching a crowd in the morning, and drinking coffee

00:13.450 --> 00:21.450
Aseri nado naikano youni hitoni wa mieru daro
People must see me as if I don't have any worries

00:22.080 --> 00:29.920
lma menomae ni atomodori dekinai jikan ga
I know that the time I will never be able to get back

00:30.710 --> 00:38.220
Tashika ni nagareteru koto o watashi wa shitteru
Is moving in front of me

00:38.430 --> 00:47.440
Marude kyou shika nai toiu ikikata o shitemita toki
If I live like today is the last day of my life

00:47.730 --> 00:55.490
Saisho ni nani ga mieru darou
I wonder what I can see first

00:56.570 --> 01:00.830
Oh please come down like an angel
Oh please come down like an angel

01:01.240 --> 01:09.250
Sore ga donnani chiisana hikari demo ii
I don't care no matter how small the light is

01:09.750 --> 01:11.750
Sugata o misete hoshii
I just wish to see its shape

01:11.750 --> 01:16.010
Oh please come down like an angel
Oh please come down like an angel

01:16.680 --> 01:22.390
lma no kimochi sonomama hanaseru
I want to meet someone

01:22.390 --> 01:22.680
Rumiko Takahashi Anthology
Mermaid Forest
lma no kimochi sonomama hanaseru
I want to meet someone

01:22.680 --> 01:29.150
Mermaid Forest
Rumiko Takahashi Anthology
Sonna hito ni deaitai
Who I can tell my honest feelings to

01:29.150 --> 01:30.980
Mermaid Forest
Rumiko Takahashi Anthology

01:42.990 --> 01:44.080
It's hot.

01:51.430 --> 01:53.260
Mana, what are you doing?

01:57.540 --> 02:00.270
Yuta, what's this?

02:00.510 --> 02:01.940
It's a cat.

02:02.310 --> 02:03.110
A cat?

02:06.150 --> 02:07.310
Let it go.

02:08.850 --> 02:10.010
I'm taking it along.

02:10.190 --> 02:12.450
No, don't. It'll die soon.

02:12.920 --> 02:15.690
Die?
Do cats stay dead once they die?

02:16.790 --> 02:17.920
They stay dead.

02:19.630 --> 02:21.460
Cats are poor things.

02:33.290 --> 02:37.800
Episode 4
Mermaid Forest
(Part I)

02:47.690 --> 02:48.850
Are you tired?

02:49.060 --> 02:51.490
I've been walking for
long periods of time these days.

02:51.490 --> 02:53.520
I'm not tired at all.

02:54.230 --> 02:57.060
That's because you were
sound asleep on my back.

02:57.900 --> 03:00.330
You can't force yourself
with those legs.

03:06.740 --> 03:08.870
Now stay here until I wake up, OK?

03:10.280 --> 03:12.750
You don't have a
normal human's body.

03:14.320 --> 03:15.250
OK?

03:32.900 --> 03:34.600
<i>Are you traveling?</i>

03:34.770 --> 03:37.600
<i>Yeah. I can't stay long</i>
<i>in any one place.</i>

03:40.610 --> 03:43.600
<i>I can't live. I only survive.</i>

03:47.250 --> 03:48.740
<i>Are you alone?</i>

03:49.020 --> 03:52.580
<i>Yeah.</i>
<i>I've always been alone. Always...</i>

03:52.960 --> 03:54.620
<i>I'm sorry to say...</i>

03:54.620 --> 03:58.920
<i>but there probably isn't any way</i>
<i>for you to return to a normal human.</i>

04:00.860 --> 04:02.590
<i>There are tough times too?</i>

04:02.900 --> 04:03.830
<i>Sometimes.</i>

04:04.200 --> 04:08.800
<i>But maybe it's not too bad to</i>
<i>keep living until we get tired of it.</i>

04:11.470 --> 04:13.910
<i>Mana, where are you going?</i>

04:14.110 --> 04:17.040
<i>Wait.</i>
<i>Are you going to leave me?</i>

04:17.310 --> 04:18.040
<i>Mana!</i>

04:25.050 --> 04:26.040
A dream...

04:28.520 --> 04:29.920
Not a good omen.

04:36.500 --> 04:37.360
Mana?

04:38.170 --> 04:39.030
Mana!

04:43.810 --> 04:45.360
Let's head back.

04:45.870 --> 04:48.710
Yuta says he misses me
if I'm not around.

04:51.110 --> 04:52.940
Hey, where are you going?

04:56.490 --> 04:57.350
Wait!

04:57.990 --> 04:59.320
Get out of the way!

05:07.160 --> 05:08.990
Mana! Mana!

05:09.300 --> 05:10.930
A girl got hit by a truck!!

05:10.930 --> 05:12.920
Officer, this way!

05:13.040 --> 05:15.700
She's been taken to Dr. Shiina's!

05:18.210 --> 05:19.410
SHIINA CLINIC

05:19.410 --> 05:21.130
SHIINA CLINIC
Doctor! How is she?

05:21.130 --> 05:21.210
Doctor! How is she?

05:21.880 --> 05:25.240
Oh, well, it's a bit of
a difficult situation.

05:25.580 --> 05:27.480
A bit of a difficult situation?

05:27.750 --> 05:29.580
Don't tell me she died.

05:30.620 --> 05:31.640
You are?

05:31.820 --> 05:33.380
I'm her friend!

05:36.220 --> 05:41.250
The thing is, she walked away
while I turned away for a moment.

05:42.230 --> 05:44.130
But the truck...

05:44.570 --> 05:48.200
Luckily, she only suffered a minor
concussion and some scratches.

05:48.700 --> 05:52.640
Well, I was going to let her rest for
a while and check her condition, but...

05:53.510 --> 05:54.340
Mana!

05:54.540 --> 05:55.530
Hey!

06:27.010 --> 06:28.870
Is she really dead?

06:29.580 --> 06:30.410
Yes.

06:30.750 --> 06:33.870
When she was brought into
my clinic, she was already...

06:34.520 --> 06:37.420
Dr. Shiina, I appreciate you
taking trouble as always.

06:37.590 --> 06:39.280
It's all right, Towa.

06:39.990 --> 06:44.760
You're truly a kind man.
For such a person as myself...

06:45.890 --> 06:47.490
I'm getting old.

06:48.060 --> 06:52.430
This may be the last time
I can help you.

06:57.340 --> 07:00.000
Doctor! What are you doing?

07:00.310 --> 07:01.330
Sawa.

07:01.640 --> 07:04.670
You've brought in
a filthy thing again.

07:04.910 --> 07:08.180
How much longer do you
intend to keep doing this?

07:09.990 --> 07:12.680
Until I find the mermaid, Sawa.

07:14.520 --> 07:17.320
You should already be
well aware of that.

07:17.560 --> 07:18.820
Such a thing...

07:19.590 --> 07:23.890
Why, Sawa, the pain in
my arm is unbearable.

07:24.030 --> 07:25.900
I'd like to replace it
as soon as possible.

07:25.900 --> 07:28.030
Please don't interfere.
I beg you.

07:29.740 --> 07:31.970
Sawa, please leave.

07:32.140 --> 07:33.270
Doctor!

07:42.450 --> 07:44.580
She's come back to life...

07:54.800 --> 07:56.490
I cut her with a scalpel, and yet...

07:57.030 --> 07:58.900
The wound is gone.

08:02.140 --> 08:03.370
Where's Yuta?

08:07.610 --> 08:08.600
Mana!

08:09.810 --> 08:11.010
Mana!

08:11.180 --> 08:13.700
Damn, where has she gone?

08:18.420 --> 08:18.980
That's...

08:19.750 --> 08:22.050
Hello! Somebody!
Is anybody home?

08:23.690 --> 08:24.990
That doctor...

08:25.480 --> 08:26.230
VILLAGE POLICE SUBSTATION

08:26.230 --> 08:28.230
VILLAGE POLICE SUBSTATION
Dr. Shiina?

08:28.230 --> 08:28.530
VILLAGE POLICE SUBSTATION

08:28.530 --> 08:29.930
VILLAGE POLICE SUBSTATION
He's not at the clinic.

08:29.930 --> 08:29.980
VILLAGE POLICE SUBSTATION

08:30.670 --> 08:32.670
I need to see him,
there's something I want to ask.

08:32.670 --> 08:34.260
Let's see.

08:35.100 --> 08:38.440
Oh, today is the day when
he visits the Kannagi residence.

08:38.910 --> 08:40.500
Where's their house?

08:40.980 --> 08:41.940
Well...

08:43.180 --> 08:44.950
Go into the Mermaid Forest, and...

08:44.950 --> 08:46.410
Mermaid Forest?

08:47.120 --> 08:51.380
Yeah. It's a part of the Kannagi
Family's property. There's a legend...

08:52.690 --> 08:55.180
that a mermaid is buried
somewhere in the forest.

08:55.460 --> 08:59.150
You know, they say mermaid is an elixir
for eternal youth and immortality.

09:01.530 --> 09:04.330
They say that one of their ancestors...

09:04.670 --> 09:07.000
caught a mermaid
and buried it in secret.

09:07.740 --> 09:10.140
Well, it's just a myth, though.

09:24.000 --> 09:25.660
KANNAGI

09:29.460 --> 09:31.450
Hey, is anybody home?

09:34.730 --> 09:35.990
Then, I've got no choice.

09:48.580 --> 09:49.310
Who are you?

09:54.350 --> 09:56.210
Can I help you?

09:57.020 --> 09:58.250
<i>White hair?</i>

09:59.690 --> 10:00.660
Do you live here?

10:01.290 --> 10:02.280
Yes.

10:03.090 --> 10:05.460
A doctor named
Shiina is here, isn't he?

10:06.130 --> 10:07.650
Dr. Shiina?

10:08.930 --> 10:10.020
Why?

10:10.570 --> 10:13.630
A friend of mine
disappeared from his clinic.

10:14.100 --> 10:15.230
Your friend?

10:15.700 --> 10:17.540
Oh, then you're her...

10:18.810 --> 10:20.870
Mana's here?
She's here, isn't she?

10:22.910 --> 10:24.110
Bring her to me right...

10:37.390 --> 10:38.360
Damn...

10:38.990 --> 10:49.000
Rumiko Takahashi Anthology
Mermaid Forest

10:56.750 --> 10:57.970
What is this thing?

10:58.280 --> 11:00.870
It's a dog. Isn't it obvious?

11:03.520 --> 11:04.580
No, it's not obvious!

11:35.280 --> 11:36.750
He died instantly.

11:37.590 --> 11:39.350
How could this happen?

11:44.890 --> 11:46.490
Good morning.

11:46.730 --> 11:49.360
Doctor, did you sleep well?

11:49.900 --> 11:51.530
Towa, you!

11:52.100 --> 11:55.040
It wasn't me. It was the dog's doing.

11:56.910 --> 12:00.240
It'll be too pitiful to leave him
like this. Let's bury him.

12:11.450 --> 12:12.980
Doctor, look.

12:16.490 --> 12:18.460
Here, look at this.

12:19.030 --> 12:21.290
The wounds were fatal, but now...

12:44.390 --> 12:46.480
What's this?

12:47.990 --> 12:49.080
Damn!

12:52.190 --> 12:53.420
What's going on?

12:55.530 --> 12:57.360
Oh, you've already
regained your strength.

12:57.600 --> 12:59.460
One surprise after another
since yesterday.

13:00.100 --> 13:02.160
You! What have you done to Mana?

13:02.870 --> 13:03.770
I want to see her!

13:04.770 --> 13:09.610
Tell me, you two have eaten
mermaid flesh, haven't you?

13:12.450 --> 13:15.710
So immortals do exist.

13:17.420 --> 13:18.440
Why did you take Mana?

13:19.020 --> 13:21.010
What I really wanted
was a dead body.

13:21.890 --> 13:24.050
But she came back to life.

13:24.790 --> 13:28.060
I'm still deciding what to do.

13:28.700 --> 13:30.290
<i>What is she up to...?</i>

13:36.770 --> 13:37.930
I brought you some food.

13:38.440 --> 13:39.430
<i>Food?</i>

13:41.710 --> 13:43.040
Screw you!

13:43.040 --> 13:45.810
You think I'm supposed to take it easy
and enjoy food in this situation?

13:46.350 --> 13:50.980
Yes, it may be wiser not to eat.
It may be poisoned.

13:52.090 --> 13:55.540
It's her specialty to serve poison.
Isn't it, Sawa?

13:56.060 --> 13:59.030
Towa! To what levels will you
go on insulting me?!

14:00.460 --> 14:02.990
Your dentures may come flying out
of your mouth if you keep shouting.

14:11.770 --> 14:14.000
What's wrong with the
people in this house?

14:14.880 --> 14:15.710
They're not normal.

14:19.950 --> 14:20.510
<i>Mana.</i>

14:33.260 --> 14:33.960
I'll have some more.

14:35.030 --> 14:36.860
My, she eats a lot.

14:38.230 --> 14:41.760
But Towa,
what are you going to do with her?

14:44.340 --> 14:47.500
I've decided.
Let's have her stay here.

14:48.180 --> 14:51.170
I can't do that.
I have to go back to Yuta.

14:51.910 --> 14:56.510
Oh. In that case, just until
that man comes for you. Please?

14:58.550 --> 15:01.150
Why do you want me to stay here?

15:01.560 --> 15:06.120
I live here alone with that old woman,
I feel so lonesome.

15:08.700 --> 15:12.060
I'm just with Yuta, too,
but I don't feel lonesome.

15:12.770 --> 15:14.960
Oh. I envy you.

15:16.340 --> 15:18.860
And your youth as well...

15:27.820 --> 15:28.750
What's wrong?

15:32.050 --> 15:37.690
I'm sorry.
My...my body has become weak...

15:42.300 --> 15:44.790
If only I could obtain the mermaid...

15:45.930 --> 15:46.920
Mermaid?

15:48.340 --> 15:52.100
A mermaid is buried
somewhere in this forest.

15:52.640 --> 15:55.610
If only I could find it, I will...

15:56.740 --> 15:58.800
I don't want to die before that.

15:59.310 --> 16:01.370
There's a mermaid here?

16:02.720 --> 16:03.650
Yes, there is.

16:04.290 --> 16:08.880
That old wench knows the exact
location, but she won't tell me.

16:14.130 --> 16:16.820
There's a mermaid
buried in this forest.

16:33.280 --> 16:34.580
What are?

16:36.320 --> 16:40.250
I've come to like your body.

16:42.520 --> 16:44.510
Yuta...

16:56.270 --> 16:57.070
Good!

16:57.170 --> 16:58.760
One, two!

17:29.770 --> 17:30.930
You should get out of here.

17:33.880 --> 17:35.870
She's a dreadful woman.

17:36.940 --> 17:40.250
Oh, you're not so crazy
after all, old lady.

17:40.250 --> 17:42.980
Who's that woman?
Your granddaughter?

17:44.950 --> 17:48.220
She's my elder twin sister.

17:49.520 --> 17:53.220
Twin sister?
Then she's also immortal?

17:54.200 --> 17:57.690
Unlike you two,
she's only young on the outside...

17:58.230 --> 18:00.290
but her inside is the same as mine.

18:01.370 --> 18:06.110
It's been already 60 years since
she was attacked by a severe illness...

18:06.110 --> 18:08.840
and was told there was
no hope of recovery.

18:09.910 --> 18:12.180
<i>Dr. Shiina, is Towa...?</i>

18:12.550 --> 18:14.210
<i>I'm afraid she's already...</i>

18:17.590 --> 18:19.020
<i>Sister...</i>

18:19.490 --> 18:20.450
<i>Sawa.</i>

18:20.790 --> 18:22.260
<i>Yes, Father.</i>

18:23.390 --> 18:28.800
<i>If Towa does not recover, you will be</i>
<i>the only heiress of the Kannagi Family.</i>

18:28.930 --> 18:29.590
<i>Yes.</i>

18:29.960 --> 18:34.090
<i>To inherit the estate means</i>
<i>to protect the Mermaid Mound.</i>

18:34.600 --> 18:36.870
<i>You must know its location...</i>

18:36.870 --> 18:39.470
<i>but you must never violate</i>
<i>or let others violate it.</i>

18:39.470 --> 18:40.340
<i>Yes.</i>

18:40.740 --> 18:44.750
Through the ages, the Kannagi Family
has protected the mound...

18:44.750 --> 18:46.940
and kept doing research on mermaids.

18:47.650 --> 18:50.180
There was a mermaid
carcass in the mound...

18:50.180 --> 18:52.720
as well as various
poisons and medicines.

18:52.720 --> 18:57.350
Having inherited them all,
I was attracted to a foolish idea.

18:58.490 --> 19:00.390
<i>Towa, here...</i>

19:00.800 --> 19:03.290
<i>It's a medicine kept</i>
<i>in the Mermaid Mound.</i>

19:03.760 --> 19:05.320
<i>Don't tell Father.</i>

19:06.230 --> 19:07.700
<i>A medicine...</i>

19:08.300 --> 19:10.000
<i>Mermaid's lifeblood.</i>

19:10.340 --> 19:14.040
<i>Mermaids are said to have</i>
<i>eternal youth and immortality.</i>

19:16.010 --> 19:18.480
<i>Its lifeblood must work on you. Here.</i>

19:19.810 --> 19:24.550
<i>I don't want you to die, Towa.</i>
<i>You're the only sister I have.</i>

19:26.620 --> 19:30.180
Out of sheer desire to
keep my elder sister alive, I...

19:31.090 --> 19:32.320
However...

19:38.030 --> 19:39.500
<i>I can't breathe...</i>

19:50.110 --> 19:54.710
Because of the extreme agony,
her hair turned white overnight.

19:55.020 --> 19:57.520
Her appearance remained
unchanged after that...

19:57.520 --> 20:00.790
but for many decades, she was treated
as if she'd died from the illness...

20:00.790 --> 20:07.130
and was confined to this room
until our father passed away.

20:09.060 --> 20:10.660
A tale that brings back
memories, does it not?

20:13.730 --> 20:17.500
Although I haven't spent a day
without thinking about it.

20:18.570 --> 20:19.270
Towa...

20:22.410 --> 20:23.470
Mana!

20:27.010 --> 20:29.210
Mana, wake up Mana!

20:30.220 --> 20:32.480
Towa, what on earth are you?

20:32.850 --> 20:34.840
My arm is in pain.

20:35.190 --> 20:36.990
I have to have it replaced soon.

20:37.560 --> 20:38.320
Have it replaced?

20:38.760 --> 20:39.560
Yes.

20:39.830 --> 20:42.590
Simply by matching the incisions,
an arm can be grafted on to my body.

20:43.560 --> 20:45.530
I've done it so many times.

20:45.530 --> 20:48.500
Breaking open a grave and
taking an arm from a fresh corpse.

20:49.270 --> 20:51.930
But after a few years...

20:53.310 --> 20:56.400
the new arm turns into the same
state my original arm was in.

20:56.880 --> 20:59.180
But that girl is still alive.

20:59.550 --> 21:03.070
That's right. I now have
an immortal body in my hands.

21:03.550 --> 21:07.820
So, this time, I'm going to
replace my entire body.

21:08.720 --> 21:10.590
What are you thinking?

21:16.300 --> 21:17.960
Come on out, Sawa.

21:18.400 --> 21:21.730
Why, I wouldn't want you
to die in a place like this.

21:23.770 --> 21:27.870
Come out.
You're the only sister I have.

21:34.650 --> 21:35.550
Wait.

21:43.560 --> 21:45.320
You can play with the dog for a while.

21:48.560 --> 21:49.190
Mana!

21:58.970 --> 22:00.570
Mana, Mana!

22:01.280 --> 22:02.770
Mana!

22:25.030 --> 22:33.540
Mukashi no koto datowa mada katazuke rarenai
It's just something in the past, but I still can't forget it

22:34.910 --> 22:43.420
ltsumade kakaruno to anata wa warau kedo
"How long does it take?" You smiled at me

22:44.880 --> 22:53.760
Dorekurai oboete iru hidoku naki nagara
How much do you remember? I cried hard

22:54.810 --> 23:04.320
Dorekurai oboete iru anokoto to ieba
How much do you remember if I talk about "that thing"?

23:09.410 --> 23:18.410
ltsumademo mada utsumuite
I still look down

23:19.370 --> 23:27.880
Tobikoe rarenai mizutamari
I can't jump over the puddle

23:29.010 --> 23:38.520
Wakaranakunaru moshikasuruto
I'm confused

23:38.850 --> 23:48.360
Kawarenai no wa watashi dake kana
Maybe I'm the only one who still can't change

23:53.320 --> 24:02.880
Mukashi no koto datowa mada katazuke rarenai
It's just something in the past, but I still can't forget it

24:07.330 --> 24:10.790
Replace the entire body?
No, Mana's alive!

24:11.270 --> 24:13.330
Not everyone becomes immortal.

24:14.540 --> 24:17.110
Towa finally found
the Mermaid Mound...

24:17.110 --> 24:19.100
and pushed Mana
down into the dark pit.

24:19.550 --> 24:22.310
And what we saw there was...

24:23.380 --> 24:26.720
The ill fate of the sisters Towa
and Sawa will now be revealed.

24:28.590 --> 24:30.610
Next, Episode 5
"Mermaid Forest, Part II."

24:30.610 --> 24:32.690
Episode 5
Mermaid Forest
(Part II)
Next, Episode 5
"Mermaid Forest, Part II."

24:32.690 --> 24:34.940
Episode 5
Mermaid Forest
(Part II)
